  <section class="project-section">
    <h2>Overview</h2>
    <p>
      This project explores shader techniques that create strong visual variation without expensive simulation or heavy texture memory. The work uses flow maps, baked masks, vertex noise, packed texture channels, and simple time-based animation to keep runtime cost manageable.
    </p>
  </section>

