      <h2>Technical Highlights</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="detail-list">
      <div>
        <h3>Mask-driven materials</h3>
        <p>Used packed channels and baked distance information to localize effects and reduce texture lookups.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Animated surface variation</h3>
        <p>Combined wave textures, flow offsets, and time-based UV animation for lava, water, and cloud motion.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Mobile-friendly tradeoffs</h3>
        <p>Favored simple sampling, channel packing, and authored masks over costly procedural simulation.</p>
      </div>
